{"id": "EUVD-2026-108333", "enisaUuid": "81618907-5f2a-3f7d-934a-3c104d1dbe44", "description": "Ghidra before 12.2 contains a resource allocation without limits vulnerability in ExtensionUtils.unzipToInstallationFolder() that extracts every extension ZIP entry without limiting file count. Attackers who persuade a user to install a crafted extension archive with many files can exhaust filesystem inodes, causing project writes and other processes to fail.", "datePublished": "2026-10-22T19:14:02", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-22T19:14:02", "baseScore": 6.8, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/NationalSecurityAgency/ghidra/security/advisories/GHSA-j5q9-fhqg-q995", "https://github.com/NationalSecurityAgency/ghidra/commit/7cb4e778efb69acb1919f841ad46d0da36e77eeb", "https://github.com/NationalSecurityAgency/ghidra/releases/tag/Ghidra_12.2_build", "https://github.com/NationalSecurityAgency/ghidra", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/ghidra-before-12.2-denial-of-service-via-extension-archive-install"], "aliases": ["GHSA-2jjf-r2xm-9jmp", "CVE-2026-115397"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.0, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "69178543-4de2-36bf-8bbb-b3bf498f35c1", "product": {"name": "Ghidra", "vendor": {"name": "NSA"}}, "product_version": "0 <12.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "28ca4f95-b624-35bf-b131-95eccec0a195", "vendor": {"name": "NationalSecurityAgency"}}], "isExploited": false}